  "bodyHash": "0550a8dc2d608206",
  "content": "\n\nПривет мир\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/31qnTHav/images/9bcdf20013cd9ac82325a0b7c3540ddf05644af9.png\"/>\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/Diversity\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"github\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diversity\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/faewufs-diversity\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"> \n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://faewulf.xyz/discord/\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n# 📖 概述\n\nDiversity 是一款 Minecraft 模组，引入了广泛的功能以提升游戏体验。从生活便利性改进到新的生物行为和各种随机小改动，本模组应有尽有。本模组也支持仅服务端安装运行。\n\n\n| **当前功能**：68（最新版本 +1）  |\n| --- |\n\n\n### `2.4.0` 更新内容\n\n- 甘蔗现在可以生长/放置在带有 `diversity:strong_support_sugarcane` 标签的方块上，不再需要附近有水。默认方块：泥巴、泥泞的红树林根须。\n- 现已要求安装 `Faewulf's Lib` 作为库依赖。抱歉带来不便。\n- `Beacon Extended`（信标扩展）模块将信标的范围和持续时间延伸至 4 级之上！每超过 4 级增加一层，范围额外增加 20 格，最高可达 10 级。\n- 新增 `Day counter`（天数计数器）选项，可修改白天刻（仅在您了解其作用时修改）。\n- 狐狸食用浆果后会自动繁殖。\n- 新背包新增两项附魔：`Vacuum`（自动吸入背包中所有新拾取物品）和 `Selective Vacuum`（仅吸入背包中已存在的同类物品）。\n- `Spy glass what is that?`（望远镜“那是什么？”）新增配置选项（使用范围、显示信息、距离、名称）。\n- `No saddled mobs wandering`（替代了 `No tamed horse wandering`）现影响所有可装备马鞍的生物。（支持模组生物）\n\n### ⚠️ 1.20.1 版本说明\n本模组的原版基于 1.21 开发，回退至 `1.20.1` 的版本将不可避免地缺少部分功能，且暂无重新添加的计划：\n- 红石灯泡 1 刻延迟\n- 随机尺寸的鱼\n- 更小的蜜蜂\n- 战锤旋转方块\n- 自定义附魔非数据驱动，请禁用此功能以使模组仅服务端运行（若启用，则客户端也必须安装该模组）\n\n# ✨ 功能详情\n\n### 额外合成表\n\n<details>\n  <summary>新背包合成表</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/bundleRecipe.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle Recipe\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>可疑的沙/砾石</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susSand.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle Recipe\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susGravel.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle Recipe\">\n</details>\n\n### 生活便利改进\n\n<details>\n  <summary>红石灯泡 1 刻延迟（默认禁用）（仅 1.21）</summary>\n  <p>使红石灯泡区块的延迟为 1 刻，与快照版本一致。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/1tickdelayBulbBlock-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"1tick Delay Bulb\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>备用附魔类型（1.21 仅服务端）</summary>\n  <p>为四种保护类附魔添加弱化版本。\\n这些附魔提供与原版相同的效果，但威力仅为原版的 25%。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Enchantment Backup preview\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Enchantment Backup\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>骨粉珊瑚扇/珊瑚块</summary>\n  <p>珊瑚扇和珊瑚块可使用骨粉（仅限温暖海洋生物群系）生长成珊瑚礁。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealCoral.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Bonemeal corals\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>骨粉小型花朵</summary>\n  <p>种植在菌丝上的小型花朵（凋蕊玫瑰与火把花除外）可使用骨粉使其向周围扩散。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealSmallFlower.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Bonemeal small flowers\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>`Beacon Extended`（信标扩展）</summary>\n  <p>将信标的范围和持续时间延伸至 4 级之上！每超过 4 级增加一层，范围额外增加 20 格，最高可达 10 级。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>战利品旗帜</summary>\n  <p>添加一些类似不祥旗帜的战利品旗帜。可通过 Boss 掉落、牧羊人村民的礼物（村庄英雄）等获得……</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/trophyBanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Trophy banners\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>新背包附魔（1.21 仅服务端）</summary>\n  <p>为新背包添加 2 项附魔（自动填充与容量扩展）。若在客户端安装本模组，物品栏指示器将正确计算。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bundleEnchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle enchantments\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>更高效的附魔台</summary>\n  <p>附魔台可接受放置在两格外的书架，并能透过非实体方块检测书架。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/expandedEnchatingTable.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Expanded Enchanting Table\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>穿透墙壁点击告示牌与物品展示框</summary>\n  <p>当告示牌或物品展示框放置在箱子、 barrel 或潜影盒（容器方块）上时，允许玩家手持物品右键穿透点击它们。行为与正常打开的容器完全相同。<br/>\nShift 键可旋转物品/编辑告示牌。\n    </p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/clickThrough.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Click Through Sign and ItemFrame\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>天数计数器</summary>\n  <p>记录并显示已过去的天数。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/day_counter-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Day counter\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>深板岩生成器</summary>\n  <p>当岩浆与水在 Y=8 以下交汇时，生成的石头和圆石将被深板岩替换。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/deepslate_generator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Deepslate generator\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>隐形物品展示框</summary>\n  <p>通过 Shift + 右键将未染色的玻璃板放入物品展示框来使其隐形。持有物品时保持隐形，否则将显示粒子作为提示。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/invisibleItemFrame.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Invisible ItemFrame\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>更快的铜块氧化</summary>\n  <p>铜块及其变体在雨水和水中氧化速度更快。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterOxidization.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Faster Copper Block Oxidation\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>更快的矿车</summary>\n  <p>铺设在 `砾石` 上的铁轨将使矿车及其变体行驶速度加快。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterMinecart.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"FasterMinecart\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>发光浆果提供发光效果</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glow-berries_glow-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Glow berries give glow effect\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>潜影盒标签显示</summary>\n  <p>放置潜影盒时将显示其自定义名称。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/shulkerLabel.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Shulker box label\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>可使用的空可疑沙/砾石</summary>\n  <p>您可以按住 Shift 右键将物品存入空的可疑沙/砾石中。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/usableSusBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Suspicious Sand/Gravel\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>无经验等级限制的铁砧</summary>\n  <p>移除铁砧的“过于昂贵”限制。客户端仍会显示“过于昂贵”提示，但功能正常使用。若客户端也安装本模组，该问题将彻底解决。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/no_level_limit_anvil.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Anvil client\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>防止耕地被踩踏</summary>\n  <p>若实体（包括玩家）穿着摔落保护靴子或拥有缓降效果，耕地将不会被踩踏。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/farmlandTrampling.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"No farmland trampling\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>作物收获给予经验值</summary>\n  <p>收获作物时可获得经验值。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/xpCrops.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"XP from Crops\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>睡觉不设置重生点</summary>\n  <p>潜行并右键点击床即可睡觉，且不会更改重生点。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/skipSetSpawnPoint.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Sleep Without Setting Respawn Point\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>火把点燃目标</summary>\n  <p>若玩家手持火把或灵魂火把攻击目标，目标将会被点燃。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/torch_fire_attack-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"torch_light_fire\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>睡眠不跳过天气变化（默认禁用）</summary>\n<p>\n  <br>睡眠不会清除天气状态。<br>RAIN_ONLY 将仅保留降雨。<br>ALL_WEATHER 将保留降雨与雷电（此模式下雷电时将无法入睡）。\n</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>清洗已填充地图</summary>\n  <p>使用炼药锅清洗已填充的地图。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/washingFilledmap.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Washing Maps\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>潜行穿过甜浆果丛</summary>\n  <p>潜行时可穿过甜浆果丛而不受伤害。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Sneaking Sweet Berry\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>裤子防甜浆果丛伤害</summary>\n  <p>穿着裤子可避免受到甜浆果丛的伤害。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Pants Protect from Sweet Berry\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>更快的玻璃/萤石开采</summary>\n  <p>镐开采玻璃相关方块和萤石的速度更快。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glassblockMining.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Faster Pickaxe Mining\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>四元素画作</summary>\n  <p>四元素 2x2 画作现在可以在生存模式中放置。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/elementPaintings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"4 Element Painting\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>湿海绵在温暖生物群系中干燥</summary>\n  <p>放置在温暖生物群系的湿海绵最终会自然风干。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/wetsponge_dry_warmbiome-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"wetsponge_dries_warmbiomes\">\n</details>\n\n### 物品调整\n\n<details>\n  <summary>新背包可放置方块</summary>\n  <p>手持新背包并按住 Shift 左键点击地面可切换至放置模式。\n随后即可放置新背包内的方块。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/bundlePlaceBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"bundlePlaceBlock\">\n  </details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>锄头可收割多作物</summary>\n  <p>锄头可一次性收割范围内的作物。默认范围为 3x3，钻石与下界合金锄头为 5x5。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/AutoHarvest.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"HieHarvestCrops\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>战锤可旋转方块（仅 1.21）</summary>\n  <p>使用战锤（潜行 + 右键）可旋转有方向的方块（若可行）。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/maceRotateBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"maceRotateBlock\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>剪刀可拆除 TNT</summary>\n  <p>可用剪刀对点燃的 TNT 进行拆除，有一定几率使其失效。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/shearDefuseTNT.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"ShearDefuseTNT\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>剪刀偷窃村民</summary>\n  <p>潜行时使用 `剪刀` 对村民进行偷窃。\n正面偷窃极易激怒村民；从背后偷窃可降低风险，或使用隐身药水完全消除风险。\n偷窃村民有概率重置其职业。职业等级越高，重置概率越低。\n  </p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/pickpocketVillager.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"ShearPickpocketVillager\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>剪刀抑制植物生长</summary>\n  <p>可用剪刀对 `树苗`、`竹子`、`藤蔓` 和 `甘蔗` 进行处理以阻止其生长。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/shearPreventPlantGrow.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"ShearPreventPlantGrow\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>望远镜“那是什么？”</summary>\n  <p>使用望远镜可查看额外的方块/实体信息（音符盒、循声守卫冷却时间、红石信号强度、熔炉内储存的经验值等……），默认探测半径为 5 格，使用望远镜缩放时探测范围扩展至 32 格。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/spyglassWhatIsThat-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"spyglassHUD\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>史莱姆区块探测器</summary>\n  <p>手持 `史莱姆球`、`史莱姆块` 或带有 `diversity:slime_detector` 标签的物品时，若处于史莱姆区块内将发出粒子与声音提示。行走/奔跑时触发概率为 10%，潜行时触发概率为 70%。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>三叉戟可召唤雷暴（重型，灵感源自 Vanilla Tweaks 的“引雷”）</summary>\n  <p>若站在最高 Y 层并将附魔引雷的三叉戟（耐久度剩余 >50%）朝天空投掷，将召唤雷暴。作为交换，三叉戟将失去引雷附魔并消耗全部剩余耐久（但不会损坏）。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/trident_call_thunderstorm-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"trident_call_thunderstrorm\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>时钟显示时间</summary>\n  <p>使用时钟可直接显示当前世界的实时时间。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>时钟查看村民作息</summary>\n  <p>手持时钟右键点击任意工作台方块，即可查看对应村民的工作日程。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/clockCheckSchedule-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"clockSchedule\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>涂蜡方块探测器</summary>\n  <p>潜行时手持望远镜，涂蜡的铜质方块将发出粒子提示。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/waxBlockIndicator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"waxBlockCheck\">\n</details>\n\n### 生物调整与行为\n\n<details>\n  <summary>九命猫（默认禁用）</summary>\n  <p>猫咪拥有 9 条命。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/9_lives_cat-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Cat has 9 lives\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>静音命名牌</summary>\n  <p>命名牌包含 'silent' 或 'shutup' 可使生物保持沉默。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>幼年命名牌</summary>\n  <p>命名牌包含 'baby' 将强制幼年动物永远保持幼年状态。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>可梳理羽毛的鹦鹉/鸡</summary>\n  <p>梳理鹦鹉或鸡的羽毛时会掉落羽毛。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/brushChickenParrot.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Brush Parrot/Chicken\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>爆炸嗅探者</summary>\n  <p>右键向嗅探者投掷粉末（火药、烈焰粉、糖、红石粉、萤石粉）将使其嗅探并……<br/>\n“以此教导孩子们切勿嗅闻未知事物。”<br/>\n- Faewulf\n</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/ExplodeSniffer.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Explosive Sniffer\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>山羊掉落羊毛与羊肉</summary>\n  <p>击杀山羊时有概率掉落羊毛与羊肉。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>苔藓块上的嗅探者</summary>\n  <p>嗅探者在苔藓块上嗅探时，会掉落孢子花/小型垂滴叶。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/snifferMossBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Sniffer on Moss Block\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>抚摸宠物</summary>\n  <p>潜行 + 右键与宠物（狼、猫、马、鹦鹉）互动即可抚摸它们。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/patYourpets.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Pat Your Pet\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>狐狸埋藏物品</summary>\n  <p>狐狸可将物品埋藏在沙子或砾石中。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/foxBuryItems.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Fox Bury Items\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>更小的蜜蜂（仅 1.21）</summary>\n  <p>蜜蜂体型缩小为默认的一半。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/smallerBee.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Smaller Bees\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>随机尺寸的鱼/鱿鱼（仅 1.21）</summary>\n  <p>鱼和鱿鱼的体型变为随机大小。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/randomSizeFishes.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Random Size Fish/Squid\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>猪灵与金色镶边盔甲</summary>\n  <p>猪灵会将带有金色镶边的盔甲视为金制盔甲。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/piglinGoldenTrim-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Piglin and Golden Armor\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>驯服马/驴/骡不再游荡</summary>\n  <p>佩戴马鞍的驯服动物将不再四处游荡。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/noWanderingTamedHorse.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Tamed Horse/Donkey/Mule\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>马/骡/驴可乘船</summary>\n  <p>马、驴和骡子现在可以乘坐船只！</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/horseSitOnBoat.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Horses in Boats\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>草垛上的鸡蛋消失后自动孵化</summary>\n  <p>放置在草垛上的鸡蛋在被移除后仍会尝试孵化。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/eggOnGroundTryHatch-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Egg hatch despawn\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>兔子食用胡萝卜后可繁殖。</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/rabbitAutoBreedWithCarrotCrops-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"RabbitAutoBreed\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>狐狸食用浆果后可繁殖。</summary>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>雪傀儡产生细雪。</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/snowGolemGivesPowderSnow.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"SnowGolemProducesPowderSnow\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>流浪商人出现提示</summary>\n  <p>流浪商人出现时向玩家发送提示信息。</p>\n</details>\n\n### 指令\n\n<details>\n  <summary>/slimechunkcheck（v2.1.0 已移除）</summary>\n  <p>用于检查当前所在区块是否为史莱姆区块的指令。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>/emote</summary>\n  <p>在聊天栏发出喵叫、呼噜、呜喵和汪叫等音效。灵感来源于插件 [PlayerMeowing](https://modrinth.com/plugin/playermeowing)。</p>\n</details>\n\n### 诅咒/整活\n\n<details>\n  <summary>疏水鞘翅（默认禁用）</summary>\n  <p>鞘翅在雨天或水中无法使用。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/cursed/hydrophobic_elytra-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Hydrophobic_elytra\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>末地石是奶酪（默认禁用）（仅 1.21）</summary>\n  <p>你可以吃掉末地石 :)</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>反向幻翼生成条件（默认禁用）</summary>\n  <p>若玩家连续睡眠跳过夜晚，幻翼将生成。</p>\n</details>\n\n# ⚙️ 使用方法\n\n客户端：\n可通过 ModMenu 访问配置界面。\n\n服务端：\n几乎所有功能均可通过配置文件 `config/diversity.toml` 进行开关设置。\n\n# ⚠️ 前置模组\n\n- Fabric API\n- Faewulf's Lib\n- （可选）权限管理模组，如 \"Luck Perms\"\n\n# 🪧 权限\n\n| ⚠️ **注意！** 在模组版本 2.0.0（及更高版本）中，此权限系统将被移除，目前改为使用 Minecraft 内置权限等级 [详见此处](https://minecraft.wiki/w/Ops.json_format) |\n| --- |\n\n若通过配置文件启用了“权限模式”（默认禁用），您可以通过任何权限管理模组来管理功能。<br/>\n*请注意，若启用了权限模式但未安装权限管理模组，Diversity 将无法正常运行。\n\n目前仅有 2 项权限：\n\n| 功能             | 权限标识                | 权限等级（2.0.0 及以上） |\n|:-----------------|:--------------------------|:--------------------------|\n| /emote           | diversity.emote           | 1 |\n| /slimechunkcheck* | diversity.slimechunkcheck* | 1 |\n\n- (*) 已在 v2.1.0 中移除\n\n# 🛠️ 兼容性\n\nDiversity 专为与其他 Fabric 模组兼容而设计。如遇任何问题，请在模组的 Issues 页面反馈。\n\n# 👍 支持与反馈\n\n如需技术支持、功能建议或 Bug 报告，请访问模组的 GitHub Issues 页面。\n或加入我的 Discord 服务器：[链接](https://faewulf.xyz/discord)\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n\n# 📜 许可协议\n您可以在整合包中使用本模组，只需注明原作者即可。",
